      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s namesake falls were submerged when the Max Starcke Dam created Lake Marble Falls in 1951, yet they reappear when the lake is lowered for repairs.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        16,
        7
      ],
