      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Granite from Granite Mountain supplied the stone for the Texas State Capitol, the Coca‑Cola Building in Atlanta, and the Crocker Building in San Francisco.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
